{"unit_id":"daimingxing__dsh-reload#card-zh","repo":"daimingxing/dsh-reload","commit":"812ec274300572f693a406793e79b32e71bc75cc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-reload 是面向 DSH 插件开发的热重载工具，可在文件改动后重新加载插件，并提供桌面客户端重启入口。它在 Host 注册 dsh_hot_reload 工具和状态、重载、重启接口，在客户端设置页及可选侧边栏、悬浮入口提供操作按钮。热重载会报告替换结果和需要重启的模块；重启前会检查会话与后台任务。适合频繁修改 DSH 插件并希望减少手动重开客户端的开发者。重启仅支持 Windows 桌面端。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:142-245","index.js:257-312","client.js:1004-1080"]}
{"unit_id":"daimingxing__dsh-reload#card-en","repo":"daimingxing/dsh-reload","commit":"812ec274300572f693a406793e79b32e71bc75cc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-reload lets DSH plugin developers reload changed plugins and restart the desktop client. It adds a hot reload tool and settings controls, with optional sidebar and floating buttons. Reload reports replaced plugins; restart checks active sessions and jobs. Restart works only on Windows desktop.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:142-245","index.js:257-312","client.js:1004-1080"]}
