{"unit_id":"daimingxing__dsh-reload#caveat-1","repo":"daimingxing/dsh-reload","commit":"812ec274300572f693a406793e79b32e71bc75cc","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-reload 使用前须知：桌面客户端重启仅支持 Windows；插件热重载需要当前 profile 提供 HMR 和 profile 上下文。被热重载的插件会重新加载，客户端重启则会关闭窗口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/restart.js:57-77","lib/hot-reload.js:107-115"]}
